<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Warner Bros deal in Spain.</title>
<headline>EU clears Warner Bros deal in Spain.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared a joint venture between Warner Bros, Portuguese media group Lusomundo and Sogecable to operate multiplex cinemas in Spain.</p>
<p>In a statement, the EU executive said that given &quot;the negligible market share of the parties in the Spanish cinema market&quot; the deal did not pose any threat to competition.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
